sequenceDiagram
  participant Host as cca-runtime
  participant LM as Lifecycle Manager
  participant CM as Configuration Manager
  participant SR as Service Registry
  participant DI as Dependency Injector
  participant Providers as Service Providers

  Host->>LM: Construct instance
  LM->>LM: Constructed → Initializing
  LM->>LM: Configuring
  LM->>CM: Apply explicit configuration
  CM-->>LM: Configuration validated
  LM->>LM: Registering Services
  LM->>SR: Register typed internal providers
  SR-->>LM: Registrations validated
  LM->>LM: Resolving Dependencies
  LM->>DI: Build and resolve dependency graph
  DI-->>LM: Dependency levels
  LM->>LM: Validating
  LM->>LM: Runtime Freeze
  LM->>LM: Starting

  loop Sequential dependency levels
    LM->>Providers: Start next dependency level
    Note over Providers: Same-level Providers MAY start concurrently
    Providers-->>LM: Dependency level started
  end

  LM->>LM: Running
  LM-->>Host: Instance running
